        "heading": "LinkedIn Ads Built For Business Growth",
        "sub_heading": "For B2B Companies, Tradies & Agencies Ready To Reach Decision Makers",
        "text": "<p>If your customers wear boots or blazers, LinkedIn is where they’re lurking. Unlike Facebook or Insta, LinkedIn’s not just social, it’s strategic. You’re not advertising to random scrollers, you’re showing up in front of business owners, project managers, builders, CEOs, and procurement leads who can greenlight serious work.</p><p>At An Agency, we use LinkedIn Ads to help local businesses crack into commercial markets, win more tenders, and get past the gatekeepers. Whether you want to promote a service, drive enquiries, or get your brand in front of the right eyeballs, we build campaigns with clear goals and commercial intent.</p><p>No fluff. Just leads worth chasing.</p>",
