    "faq_cYAhKJ": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_rrnAHz": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much should I budget for LinkedIn Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>LinkedIn Ads typically cost more per click than platforms like Facebook or Google. However, you're paying to reach a highly targeted professional audience. Starting with a daily budget of $50–$100 is common, but the ideal amount depends on your goals and industry. Remember, quality leads often come at a premium.​</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_WTif9E": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What types of businesses benefit most from LinkedIn Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>Businesses targeting professionals, decision-makers, or other businesses (B2B) see the most success. Industries like software, consulting, education, and professional services often find LinkedIn Ads particularly effective.​</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_i8T9ac": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does LinkedIn's ad auction work?",
            "answer": "<p>LinkedIn uses an auction system where your bid and the relevance of your ad determine whether it's shown. Even with a lower bid, a highly relevant ad can win the auction, making quality content crucial.</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_FzV4ax": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I target specific companies or job titles?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. LinkedIn's targeting allows you to focus on specific companies, industries, job titles, seniority levels, and more. This precision helps ensure your ads reach the most relevant audience.</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_NAFgi3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the best ad format for lead generation?",
            "answer": "<p>LinkedIn's Lead Gen Forms are highly effective. They allow users to submit their information directly within the platform, reducing friction and increasing conversion rates.​</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jtx36a": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I track conversions from my LinkedIn Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>By installing the LinkedIn Insight Tag on your website, you can track conversions, retarget visitors, and gain insights into your audience's behavior. This data is invaluable for optimizing your campaigns.</p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_hU3EcD": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I use automated bidding or manual bidding?",
            "answer": "<p>Both have their merits. Automated bidding simplifies the process and is great for beginners. Manual bidding offers more control and can be more cost-effective if you have the expertise to manage it.​</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_i9yU8a": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How important is ad creative on LinkedIn?",
            "answer": "<p>Very. Your ad's visual and copy need to resonate with a professional audience. Clear messaging, strong visuals, and a compelling call-to-action can significantly impact performance.​</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_gnkcaP": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I run video ads on LinkedIn?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Video ads can be highly engaging and are effective for storytelling, product demonstrations, or sharing customer testimonials. Keep them concise and relevant to your target audience.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Fbaqnw": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to see results from LinkedIn Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>It varies. Some campaigns see immediate engagement, while others may take weeks to optimize. Consistent monitoring and tweaking are key to long-term success.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/plus_1.png"
          }
        }
      },
